1
00:00:03,504 --> 00:00:06,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>真没想到 在我准备好一切的这天</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:08,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然会跟你重逢…</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:09,099 --> 00:00:14,062
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许是天上的队长在指引我们</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:14,736 --> 00:00:17,363
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿克？
-左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:17,449 --> 00:00:20,910
<c.simplifiedchinese>要不要和我再一次组建赤报队？</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:22,292 --> 00:00:25,920
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们一起推翻维新政府</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:26,551 --> 00:00:31,848
<c.simplifiedchinese>把相乐队长梦想中的新时代变为现实</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:33,355 --> 00:00:35,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起啊 大家</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:35,611 --> 00:00:37,321
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没奢望大家能理解我</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:38,115 --> 00:00:41,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>对我来说 赤报队果然是特别的</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:48,506
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心 下次再见面时
我已经犯下重罪了</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:49,262 --> 00:00:53,308
<c.simplifiedchinese>你用逆刃刀来制服我也没关系</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:01:16,275 --> 00:01:18,652
<c.simplifiedchinese>时间差不多了 我们走</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:01:20,283 --> 00:01:22,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 真冷啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:01:22,705 --> 00:01:25,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经是春天了还这么冷</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:01:25,418 --> 00:01:28,421
<c.simplifiedchinese>冬天的寒气还没散去呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:28,507 --> 00:01:32,261
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是忍不住想快点去取暖</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:01:34,644 --> 00:01:36,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:01:36,273 --> 00:01:37,357
<c.simplifiedchinese>炸弹！</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:01:38,235 --> 00:01:41,488
<c.simplifiedchinese>好几颗！犯人还在附近！</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:41,575 --> 00:01:44,161
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有警备人员到大门集合！</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:45,207 --> 00:01:49,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>调整导火线的长度
来制造出爆炸的时间差啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:49,132 --> 00:01:50,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>真周到啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:50,468 --> 00:01:54,472
<c.simplifiedchinese>就这样侵入进去 那就等于成功了</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:01:54,559 --> 00:01:57,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>把内务省炸成一堆碎片！</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:01:59,987 --> 00:02:04,533
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:35,636 --> 00:03:37,221
<c.simplifiedchinese>草坪着火了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:37,306 --> 00:03:38,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>快灭火 快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:41,064 --> 00:03:43,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>胜负就在于警官队回来前这段时间</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:43,735 --> 00:03:46,780
<c.simplifiedchinese>一鼓作气穿过花园！别停！</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:53,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>话说回来…</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:53,630 --> 00:03:56,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的确听说过 在赤报队成立前</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:57,054 --> 00:04:01,058
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长为了反抗幕府曾经纵火和抢劫</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:04:01,855 --> 00:04:02,772
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然…</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:04:06,156 --> 00:04:07,866
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 阿克？</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:04:07,951 --> 00:04:09,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么愣住了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:11,959 --> 00:04:13,586
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:14,339 --> 00:04:18,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>他竟然赶在我们之前潜入了内务省</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:18,764 --> 00:04:20,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助 他是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:21,520 --> 00:04:23,563
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:23,649 --> 00:04:25,901
<c.simplifiedchinese>传说中的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:26,947 --> 00:04:28,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊…</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:28,492 --> 00:04:32,496
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个传说中的刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:35,839 --> 00:04:38,050
<c.simplifiedchinese>你来带走左之助吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:38,845 --> 00:04:39,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:39,973 --> 00:04:44,060
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是左之助作为男子汉
自己选择的行动</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:44,148 --> 00:04:46,901
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下没有理由说三道四</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:50,286 --> 00:04:54,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下是来阻止你们的暴行</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:54,586 --> 00:04:56,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>逆刃刀…</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:58,093 --> 00:05:01,805
<c.simplifiedchinese>维新志士这次
又想站在我们对立面吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:05:02,393 --> 00:05:03,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:05:04,939 --> 00:05:06,274
<c.simplifiedchinese>这次不会输给你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:06,359 --> 00:05:07,777
<c.simplifiedchinese>看招！</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:10,534 --> 00:05:11,660
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死的维新志士！</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:12,330 --> 00:05:14,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>是 所以</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:14,542 --> 00:05:18,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下才不能
对你们的愚蠢行为坐视不理</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:20,929 --> 00:05:25,017
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手少来教训我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:28,153 --> 00:05:29,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样又如何！</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:37,254 --> 00:05:38,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>击中了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:38,382 --> 00:05:40,425
<c.simplifiedchinese>你大意了 维新志士！</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:40,511 --> 00:05:41,428
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:42,097 --> 00:05:43,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>他并没有大意</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:45,521 --> 00:05:48,607
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙躲开了</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:52,535 --> 00:05:54,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>还要再来吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:06:01,051 --> 00:06:04,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>-左之助！
-够了 住手吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:06:04,392 --> 00:06:06,310
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种东西没法打败他的</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:06:06,938 --> 00:06:11,192
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪费了不少时间
听见刚才的声音警官队就要过来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:06:11,281 --> 00:06:12,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>开什么玩笑！</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:06:12,575 --> 00:06:14,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还什么都没做成！</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:06:15,079 --> 00:06:16,873
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年的心愿</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:16,958 --> 00:06:18,543
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么可能这样就放弃…</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:19,881 --> 00:06:21,966
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿左…</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:22,051 --> 00:06:24,053
<c.simplifiedchinese>别怪我</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:25,976 --> 00:06:27,436
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:27,980 --> 00:06:31,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我们怎么逃跑？
-阿左</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:35,537 --> 00:06:37,623
<c.simplifiedchinese>你已经计划好了啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:38,293 --> 00:06:41,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不住啊 给你惹麻烦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:41,633 --> 00:06:43,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:43,219 --> 00:06:44,345
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:45,474 --> 00:06:49,311
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我继续帮着这家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:49,398 --> 00:06:53,027
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也会打倒我吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:54,450 --> 00:06:55,660
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:55,744 --> 00:06:59,081
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下可不能接受优柔寡断的同谋</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:59,167 --> 00:07:00,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以不会原谅</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:07:03,426 --> 00:07:04,803
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:16,494 --> 00:07:17,787
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的房间…</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:29,269 --> 00:07:33,732
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你找那些炸弹的话
全都让剑心拿走了</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:33,820 --> 00:07:37,282
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说会找个没人的地方埋起来</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:37,369 --> 00:07:38,579
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:38,663 --> 00:07:40,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>政府的走狗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:40,584 --> 00:07:42,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不是</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:42,755 --> 00:07:47,092
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你…是你把他带到这的？
-对</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:47,681 --> 00:07:48,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:49,810 --> 00:07:51,604
<c.simplifiedchinese>背叛了我？</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:51,689 --> 00:07:54,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>-听我说 阿克
-闭嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:54,695 --> 00:07:56,530
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会再信赖你了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:56,616 --> 00:07:58,743
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克！你究竟要干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:58,828 --> 00:08:00,997
<c.simplifiedchinese>-切腹！
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:08:01,083 --> 00:08:04,169
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算是内务省也有点人性！</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:08:04,255 --> 00:08:06,716
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要在他们面前切腹自尽</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:08:06,803 --> 00:08:10,014
<c.simplifiedchinese>来控告明治政府的恶行！</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:08:10,978 --> 00:08:13,605
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这么做有什么用？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:13,692 --> 00:08:17,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的异常死亡一定会留在世人心里！</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:17,533 --> 00:08:19,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>引导他们探究真相</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:19,912 --> 00:08:22,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>种下不信任明治政府的种子</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:22,668 --> 00:08:24,336
<c.simplifiedchinese>我现在就去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:24,422 --> 00:08:26,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>你别胡闹了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:26,258 --> 00:08:28,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么做根本没用！</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:29,724 --> 00:08:32,184
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助…永别了</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:36,904 --> 00:08:38,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>烟雾弹？</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:42,666 --> 00:08:43,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:46,591 --> 00:08:49,844
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克！</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:57,488 --> 00:08:59,865
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:09:00,952 --> 00:09:02,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅仅是炸弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:09:02,706 --> 00:09:04,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有烟雾弹和闪光弹</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:09:05,044 --> 00:09:07,129
<c.simplifiedchinese>他真是个手艺人啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:09:07,215 --> 00:09:11,094
<c.simplifiedchinese>-你费心了
-别放在心上</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:09:11,181 --> 00:09:14,101
<c.simplifiedchinese>这些东西怎样都能处理掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:14,772 --> 00:09:16,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:18,070 --> 00:09:20,531
<c.simplifiedchinese>剩下的就靠你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:24,499 --> 00:09:25,542
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:30,846 --> 00:09:34,057
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂！深更半夜你要去哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:36,148 --> 00:09:37,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 问你话呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:37,609 --> 00:09:38,902
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要去哪？</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:39,947 --> 00:09:41,157
<c.simplifiedchinese>去哪…</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:43,705 --> 00:09:46,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>我去哪才好呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:46,418 --> 00:09:47,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:51,052 --> 00:09:53,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跑在他前面了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:10:04,537 --> 00:10:07,415
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克！</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:10:16,353 --> 00:10:18,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>该死！</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:10:19,944 --> 00:10:21,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>站起来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:10:22,156 --> 00:10:24,242
<c.simplifiedchinese>-放手！
-烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:10:24,327 --> 00:10:25,912
<c.simplifiedchinese>你惹太多麻烦了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:10:25,997 --> 00:10:28,416
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我们回家！
-你自己回！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:29,379 --> 00:10:31,256
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还有事没做完！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:31,341 --> 00:10:34,344
<c.simplifiedchinese>别管我了 你个叛徒！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:34,430 --> 00:10:38,059
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？我什么时候变成叛徒了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:38,146 --> 00:10:42,234
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不是和那个维新志士合伙
破坏我的计划吗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:42,321 --> 00:10:43,656
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:43,741 --> 00:10:48,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的计划我没对别人透露一个字！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:48,125 --> 00:10:50,210
<c.simplifiedchinese>那为什么那家伙会出现在那里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:50,296 --> 00:10:51,422
<c.simplifiedchinese>我怎么知道！</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:51,506 --> 00:10:54,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙一向爱管闲事！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:54,220 --> 00:10:55,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会相信你的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:55,974 --> 00:10:57,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>把我的十年还回来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:11:03,530 --> 00:11:06,199
<c.simplifiedchinese>像个流氓一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:11:06,286 --> 00:11:08,830
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这样也算赤报队的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:11:12,506 --> 00:11:15,009
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克…你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:11:25,532 --> 00:11:27,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>别误会了</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:11:27,829 --> 00:11:30,749
<c.simplifiedchinese>对付你们 我用拳头就够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:31,503 --> 00:11:33,171
<c.simplifiedchinese>我放心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:33,256 --> 00:11:37,719
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还以为你的灵魂
已经堕落到这种地步了</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:38,308 --> 00:11:39,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>别放心的太早了</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:39,895 --> 00:11:44,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从来没有打赢过我</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:44,153 --> 00:11:45,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>住口</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:59,016 --> 00:12:01,644
<c.simplifiedchinese>-根本不痛不痒
-我也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:12:01,729 --> 00:12:04,065
<c.simplifiedchinese>你太浪荡了 左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:12:04,152 --> 00:12:06,404
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:12:16,801 --> 00:12:18,136
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:12:18,805 --> 00:12:21,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架你怎么可能是我的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:12:21,979 --> 00:12:24,732
<c.simplifiedchinese>这…这不是打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:12:27,991 --> 00:12:31,244
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我洗刷赤报队十年来的怨恨</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:12:31,331 --> 00:12:34,792
<c.simplifiedchinese>夺回荣耀的战斗！</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:12:36,299 --> 00:12:39,260
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以我不能输 我不能输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:39,347 --> 00:12:43,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助 我这十年
不像你过的那么轻松！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:12:45,442 --> 00:12:47,236
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:12:47,321 --> 00:12:49,907
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长受到那样的侮辱</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:49,993 --> 00:12:54,122
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队被明治政府冠上罪名的这十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:54,210 --> 00:12:56,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>你都干了什么！</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:56,130 --> 00:12:57,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>你日夜不停地打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:57,800 --> 00:13:01,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>打到最后
跟前维新志士做好朋友了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:13:01,683 --> 00:13:07,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从赤报队和队长
身上都学了什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:13:09,992 --> 00:13:11,576
<c.simplifiedchinese>蠢货！</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:13:12,579 --> 00:13:14,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>你有什么资格说这些！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:13:14,875 --> 00:13:16,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>你又怎么样？</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:13:16,462 --> 00:13:20,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年里把自己关起来造炸弹？</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:13:20,220 --> 00:13:24,808
<c.simplifiedchinese>想为队长洗刷污名
还有很多别的方法！</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:13:24,895 --> 00:13:29,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且现在才告发政府
已经晚了十年！</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:13:30,949 --> 00:13:33,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>你什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:13:33,121 --> 00:13:35,498
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管过去十年我们多么郁闷</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:35,584 --> 00:13:37,461
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论明治政府有多腐败</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:37,546 --> 00:13:41,800
<c.simplifiedchinese>镇上的人们
都在靠自己努力创造着新时代！</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:13:42,598 --> 00:13:44,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也亲眼看到了</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:13:44,477 --> 00:13:46,103
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个道场的小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:13:46,189 --> 00:13:50,026
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了在明治时代传播剑术每天奔波</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:13:50,113 --> 00:13:55,494
<c.simplifiedchinese>弥彦出身武士家庭
虽然现在等于是被弃之不顾了</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:13:55,582 --> 00:13:59,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他仍然日夜坚持练习竹刀！</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:14:00,592 --> 00:14:04,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>女医师惠
虽然被卷入了肮脏的生意里</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:14:04,517 --> 00:14:07,812
<c.simplifiedchinese>但她振作起来救治镇上的病人</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:14:07,898 --> 00:14:09,483
<c.simplifiedchinese>修和银次</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:14:09,568 --> 00:14:12,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>从来不抱怨他们的现状</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:14:12,658 --> 00:14:13,909
<c.simplifiedchinese>每天都很辛苦</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:14:13,993 --> 00:14:16,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使这样也一直保持笑容！</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:17,292 --> 00:14:19,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>一群有不同的经历的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:19,713 --> 00:14:22,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>昨晚一起坐下来喝酒吃饭</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:14:22,928 --> 00:14:25,264
<c.simplifiedchinese>这难道不就是队长梦想中的</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:14:25,350 --> 00:14:28,186
<c.simplifiedchinese>四民平等的时代吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:14:28,273 --> 00:14:29,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:14:30,235 --> 00:14:31,987
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想做的事呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:32,072 --> 00:14:34,283
<c.simplifiedchinese>没意义！添乱罢了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:42,217 --> 00:14:44,219
<c.simplifiedchinese>没意义？</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:47,895 --> 00:14:48,854
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:49,815 --> 00:14:53,402
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算你切腹自尽也没法改变世界的</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:54,617 --> 00:14:58,370
<c.simplifiedchinese>所有人都活在现在的新时代里</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:59,794 --> 00:15:01,170
<c.simplifiedchinese>回家吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:15:04,093 --> 00:15:07,555
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助 拔刀斋在哪里？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:15:07,643 --> 00:15:12,064
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果他把我的炸弹都上交给政府…</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:15:12,152 --> 00:15:15,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过 他不是那种人</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:15:16,869 --> 00:15:19,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>他跟我们一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:15:19,708 --> 00:15:23,212
<c.simplifiedchinese>并不能从心底认同如今政府的现状</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:15:23,842 --> 00:15:27,762
<c.simplifiedchinese>不…作为建设了新政府的一份子</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:15:27,850 --> 00:15:29,726
<c.simplifiedchinese>他比我们更不能认同</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:29,812 --> 00:15:31,313
<c.simplifiedchinese>你胡说什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:31,399 --> 00:15:33,901
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一个刽子手怎么会懂我们？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:15:33,987 --> 00:15:35,280
<c.simplifiedchinese>他懂</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:37,828 --> 00:15:41,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是明治维新时期
在暗地里活跃的刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:41,919 --> 00:15:46,799
<c.simplifiedchinese>除了暗杀活动
还做过很多其他肮脏的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:46,888 --> 00:15:47,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>正因为如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:48,766 --> 00:15:53,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>他无法眼睁睁看着
我们赤报队也做出这些肮脏勾当</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:55,322 --> 00:15:56,448
<c.simplifiedchinese>你知道吗 阿克？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:56,532 --> 00:16:01,329
<c.simplifiedchinese>听说在赤报队成立前
队长也做过一些不法的事</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:16:01,959 --> 00:16:04,837
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然我觉得那并不是他的本意</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:16:04,924 --> 00:16:09,970
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队是个以四民平等为理想的队伍</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:10,685 --> 00:16:13,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>事到如今 我们更不能玷污它的名誉</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:15,779 --> 00:16:18,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>肮脏不肮脏有什么关系！</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:18,868 --> 00:16:22,246
<c.simplifiedchinese>为了达到目的必须不择手段</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:22,834 --> 00:16:23,919
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:24,630 --> 00:16:28,717
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们赤报队就真的是伪军了</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:16:31,017 --> 00:16:33,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>大家都不肯买啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:16:33,690 --> 00:16:36,359
<c.simplifiedchinese>伪军头目的画</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:16:41,497 --> 00:16:47,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你说政府那些家伙很肮脏
你就不能跟他们一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:47,634 --> 00:16:50,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>沉稳也好 谨慎也罢</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:50,682 --> 00:16:57,063
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要践行一条
让队长在天上也可以微笑的路</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:17:48,506 --> 00:17:49,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:17:53,724 --> 00:17:54,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:56,062 --> 00:18:00,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助好像吃了克浩的鱼什么的</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:18:00,822 --> 00:18:03,199
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像往常一样打起来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:18:03,285 --> 00:18:04,578
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:18:05,372 --> 00:18:06,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>加油 左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:18:06,917 --> 00:18:08,419
<c.simplifiedchinese>快打倒他！</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:18:08,504 --> 00:18:11,174
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿克 别认输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:18:11,259 --> 00:18:13,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>被打败都别认输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:18:13,806 --> 00:18:16,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了！你赢不了我！</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:18:16,896 --> 00:18:18,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:18:18,315 --> 00:18:21,526
<c.simplifiedchinese>把你抢走的东西抢回来之前
我是不会输的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:18:21,614 --> 00:18:23,490
<c.simplifiedchinese>烦死了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:18:25,037 --> 00:18:27,164
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 左之助？</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:18:27,249 --> 00:18:29,627
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩！腿！</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:18:33,638 --> 00:18:34,805
<c.simplifiedchinese>克浩…</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:18:35,432 --> 00:18:36,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>赢了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:18:36,852 --> 00:18:38,938
<c.simplifiedchinese>干得好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:18:40,442 --> 00:18:41,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>疼…</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:18:43,616 --> 00:18:45,409
<c.simplifiedchinese>你干得很好</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:18:47,456 --> 00:18:50,668
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要用你自己的方式战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:19:01,150 --> 00:19:03,444
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的方式…</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:19:11,672 --> 00:19:15,509
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈津南后来怎么样了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:19:15,596 --> 00:19:17,015
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:19:17,934 --> 00:19:21,187
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为我毫不留情打了他一顿</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:19:21,274 --> 00:19:22,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>再见他会很尴尬啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:19:24,948 --> 00:19:29,202
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀 这不是上次的小哥嘛</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:19:29,290 --> 00:19:30,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>来得正好</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:19:31,712 --> 00:19:33,839
<c.simplifiedchinese>上次真是不好意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:19:33,924 --> 00:19:34,925
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:19:35,010 --> 00:19:39,639
<c.simplifiedchinese>月冈先生有东西托我交给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:19:40,730 --> 00:19:43,858
<c.simplifiedchinese>他说这是他最后的锦绘了</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:19:45,364 --> 00:19:47,491
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不知道他在想什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:19:47,576 --> 00:19:51,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>突然告诉我他要开始做插画报</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:19:51,417 --> 00:19:52,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>来揭露政府的不公</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:19:53,630 --> 00:19:57,550
<c.simplifiedchinese>我跟他说管制很严的 别做了</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:19:57,638 --> 00:20:02,393
<c.simplifiedchinese>难得是那么有人气的画师呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:20:03,859 --> 00:20:07,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是遗憾啊 大叔</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:21:45,520 --> 00:21:48,857
<c.simplifiedchinese>前几日的骚动到底是怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:21:49,570 --> 00:21:50,571
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:21:50,655 --> 00:21:54,034
<c.simplifiedchinese>内院花园有数处被烧</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:21:54,121 --> 00:21:57,249
<c.simplifiedchinese>另外有一部分墙面受损</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:21:57,336 --> 00:22:00,881
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是所有设施和人都没事</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:22:00,968 --> 00:22:02,720
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有人声明对此次事件负责</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:22:02,804 --> 00:22:06,350
<c.simplifiedchinese>是否有人恶意捣乱的调查正在进行中</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:22:06,437 --> 00:22:08,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>春天来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:22:08,191 --> 00:22:10,193
<c.simplifiedchinese>奇怪的人也出来活动了</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:22:11,113 --> 00:22:11,989
<c.simplifiedchinese>或许</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:22:12,699 --> 00:22:16,995
<c.simplifiedchinese>志志雄一派会不会与此有关？</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:22:17,084 --> 00:22:18,960
<c.simplifiedchinese>别胡说！</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:22:19,046 --> 00:22:21,131
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们袭击内务省？</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:22:21,217 --> 00:22:22,426
<c.simplifiedchinese>不可能！</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:22:23,429 --> 00:22:25,390
<c.simplifiedchinese>-川路
-是</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:22:25,475 --> 00:22:30,021
<c.simplifiedchinese>东京附近没有收到
志志雄一派的目击报告</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:22:30,110 --> 00:22:32,821
<c.simplifiedchinese>请放心 大久保卿</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:22:34,785 --> 00:22:38,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果是他们做的 不会没有人员伤亡</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:22:38,668 --> 00:22:41,796
<c.simplifiedchinese>但也不能掉以轻心</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:22:41,882 --> 00:22:44,927
<c.simplifiedchinese>-继续调查
-是！</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:22:47,102 --> 00:22:51,231
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集
《明治剑客浪漫谭 第零幕前篇》</c.simplifiedchinese>

